# Line endings.
#
# Git on Windows defaults to rewriting LF to CRLF in the working tree, which
# means every file shows as modified after a checkout for no reason and every
# diff is harder to read. Normalising here keeps the repository's contents
# stable regardless of who clones it and on what.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The fonts and the artwork are bytes, not text. Never let git try to normalise
# a line ending inside a woff2 or an SVG path.
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary